# Four short turns so cache and debug reports have data.
Type "Read package.json and tell me the package name in one short sentence."
Enter
Sleep 20s
Type "Now list the directory names under packages/ using bash ls, answer briefly."
Enter
Sleep 20s
Type "How many packages is that? One sentence."
Enter
Sleep 15s
Type "Read packages/supi-debug/package.json and name its version. One sentence."
Enter
Sleep 20s
Escape
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 500ms
